就这些：\n\n- 本地后端默认端口：`19000`\n- 6种状态：`idle / writing / researching / executing / syncing / error`\n- 能读 `memory/*.md` 生成“昨日小记”\n- 支持多 Agent（join key）\n- 可选 Cloudflare Tunnel 公网分享\n- 和 OpenClaw 深度集成（让龙虾做任务前后自动切状态）\n\n你要我下一步怎么做？我可以直接二选一开干：\n\n1) **给你部署到这台机器**（我直接装好并跑起来）  \n2) **给你做一份“5分钟上手中文教程”**（含你这套环境的最简配置）  \n\n你回我 `1` 或 `2` 就行。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01a0ede22534998d0169aebae489048191be2dacd0aa454798\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":7917,"output":317,"cacheRead":16896,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25130,"cost":{"input":0.013854749999999999,"output":0.004438,"cacheRead":0.0029568,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02124955}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773058789542}}
