`http://127.0.0.1:19000`\n2. 如果用手机访问，要用：`http://192.168.3.7:19000`（不是 127.0.0.1）\n3. 手机和电脑要在同一 Wi‑Fi\n\n如果第2步还是不通，基本就是 Windows 防火墙拦了。  \n你回我一句 **“开防火墙端口”**，我就直接帮你把 `19000` 放行并再测一遍。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01a0ede22534998d0169aebbb404b8819193fd667feabe3b97\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":237,"output":274,"cacheRead":26624,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27135,"cost":{"input":0.00041474999999999997,"output":0.003836,"cacheRead":0.0046592,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00890995}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773058998528}}
