{"type":"message","id":"78bfa7c4","parentId":"373668ea","timestamp":"2026-03-09T12:25:44.983Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Providing concise strategy advice**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_01a0ede22534998d0169aebc3840608191ac9647b49725d21b\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABprrw5UmG-gGVDH-QLEXNggl2gnERPcxJmw9LKu6PfXOGruAUuwrT0xd4Lf_KMIvwyN36rD4J2ccH4GrYLNzIY-gX-wKtMqk5plhMvxwjfbGrbU2oE09SR_Ck8L-3JPXhXardZSshAgsfHceFd6bz7oBl-1iSS0tsqmmTPhniO-w4gQKCuTQcrYtc0DwjITgNk5EfSxFiHJFTp3cbbBa3dwlyXmHbRE8X5Wd2oYPTnbtXDKPgr-E0A_4_apFTwjMdKQt49MY7QU5SVDjjOgxYgocIwmLjTUvrvUwUWdTGGO_72Tt_fAs93O_QVQEz1SkC0fflG4L7xDbWaGUwrwcyAxDEcYIZeG9cQzbkVvyhvpOM4RcFSVsgiPQVG7C5Gs89Wekyi1AqjFjQn7xGdEzMoUeBpQuT9p2K-TVpIPbsBK6N4xvH6VZvNfA9yHXX0Ivn9472y7b4p1blqEkSaKGCHNlbT_oUGsjhbiOeAJYk_svLSXbCA3N97WaS51AFa0jdwJjJjre1yeo8wsLpYItcM3FYBTnIiJKxSNtrkoSxLeXH-supsN9LRU_MtNdfQbg_j0Zuo_CtViWY4CHUpeSVklxt7OCGLleHrmh4eVNnvcE8EVzmeIo5LF8zrOSg1g54fh9WyU5Eqwb8WEuzDIcTRpDxsX83yOWFVZqivhf19RoAyNPtEgLCL3v4M-IB7-W-219WApjQ0rl_xxsMNHUWeMOls1OT-iQgHPNOHHbgzJF74VnkUH9cGi0WNxRxyEPlO2OSR4Wg84DV-P3-rxQ0C2GsEY6gx9jLr10szWVsrgti4Vw2zScT7inV5NNPpLaUIYfRXOyNqgTlIm6Ul22vJdPEedbAJZnXBlQ7yoPJ4-0tbKI8u9uvrSS1y5o1Y2Fq9DsSUjxPk3CcJ4XB9BlKLWqLkdrWNV8CPoTvP3trnj8by715gkfwi2JcyEw2PHWtTiZzKtHSiNDwYIClKEEWhrFX636tbA--QdnahAr6rCdFHOIcJ2SzT4AsOTi54KqpqCfPkTwKs2q5botCTZ4yLeiSU1wrKybsieePuH6Qf3sGgs-AmInYwsR82a2u_InW43Hr-So23AUb5ind9dLi905t7ZQ==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Providing concise strategy advice**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 我建议用“**部门一把总钥匙 + 关键岗位专钥匙**”的混合分法，最稳。\n\n### 推荐分配（适合你“三省六部”）\n按 9 个组织单元来：\n\n- 三省：中书、门下、尚书  \n- 六部：吏、户、礼、兵、刑、工\n\n每个单元 1 个 key，**每个 key 最多 3 个 agent**。  \n这样总容量 = `9 × 3 = 27` 个同时在线，管理也清晰。\n\n---\n\n### 为什么这样分\n- **故障隔离**：兵部爆满不会挤掉户部\n- **权限感清晰**：哪个 agent 属于哪个部门一眼看懂\n- **扩容简单**：某部超 3 人就加 `key_bing_2`\n\n---\n\n### 命名建议（直接可用）\n- `ocj_zhongshu_01`\n- `ocj_menxia_01`\n- `ocj_shangshu_01`\n- `ocj_libu_01`\n- `ocj_hubu_01`\n- `ocj_libu2_01`（礼部可写 `libu_01`，避免和吏部冲突）\n- `ocj_bingbu_01`\n- `ocj_xingbu_01`\n- `ocj_gongbu_01`\n\n> 小提醒：**吏部/礼部拼音都像 libu**，建议一个用 `libu_hr`（吏），一个用 `libu_rite`（礼），防混乱。\n\n---\n\n### 实战规则\n1. **常驻角色**（每部核心 1~2 个）固定 key  \n2. **临时角色**走“机动 key”（如 `ocj_temp_01`）  \n3. 某部超限就新增分片 key（如 `ocj_bingbu_02`）  \n4. `AGENT_NAME` 前缀加部门：`兵部-巡检`, `户部-核算`\n\n---\n\n你要的话我下一步可以直接给你一份可粘贴的 `join-keys.json` 初版（按这个分好）。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01a0ede22534998d0169aebc3964b48191b12a8647a60fcb4f\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":450,"output":547,"cacheRead":26752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27749,"cost":{"input":0.0007875,"output":0.007658,"cacheRead":0.0046816,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0131271}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773059133003}}
