{"type":"message","id":"939fdbe8","parentId":"ea76a4ad","timestamp":"2026-03-09T12:26:21.414Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_01a0ede22534998d0169aebc622d408191a964357991f55ba7\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABprrxiTFo-yFC6p8hqQ6SSbz9th5d36HLWxY9hB-t5tjXSXnrv8dxlrCzoZeSHJZo6OzyIyHK6ZJ3VbhJp6nMV0Kr9_A8VnRva_UdJH9J9Tb30vwOrrSy86Yh7-SpprjALcL00z7TEah0KrU4FuBQwRQzuZZl0gdy9zuVj99qdWn83DtrGgBKQkkHyWAao_VYFRix12TAeGAhCWpz-0rcM3iHnq42raYfbT1IR5cWhGW44LtBQ5iElc8SNy0kZfTGa2xScVzgy_mytw-S-Ougx62aFuaaD2Wkccfz7XDxnXE7nMYv3i0YjXTlaB6ZvNDfufmXoiRFNnVkq3MvqfeJBN0F8lUIvAaEi9lJbWedEEByv9es3g-PjC7-xwE6nwdvVuaxmdqOIskM3vxs-aFeXxNzEs5mdf00r2Tjjcy8tMPKc4KkFJ9Kboeyf-c2lgiiFL_ePHC_zpFldnV6C5o9KKAqEKVaDzaLRpRVITy6oPFg3qEB4S-RaWL_Y5bAYRoQ5LQmP6FPXn3yRdvNxknfoV-NtjXFkSDbuVaLqwQo8g8PhaZdEE83NjWyVU5t-JeUyUdYMlG4iaoqwfmBxsUK0zPjazByaS42mf_GVCyCo2E27GkfCyZwe-CDlY40ta2SmQeOQYa2SOrJbaPL-8Kx3vkHS_c_AmVVfIFWzekVyZ0H7W_cQCqswoxPNHkUFM3_vW3eFAtGRVFSh5rcx-kRaiUdBF0AM7hTdyRotNGevXJek6sW5nrVmgAp9_FrEJ-rxvsmcJj7nchHorNZBPeR-_HEScHSR20ULsqKX7X-s2epqFg4kxtbFdhipqmujKP6oNtfhX3fDIkt2beTBuF0vIya8HE5zWEUpWr5TAp1E9tTb_v1ZseJhDee9CBeQTdKDuaRAktEntE9SF67bOLRKzslGfw==\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 不会有大问题，按我这个分法是偏稳的 👍\n\n但我实话说，有三类常见坑，提前规避就很稳：\n\n- **地址不稳定**：内网 IP 变了，agent 会掉线  \n  → 用固定地址（局域网固定IP或公网域名）\n\n- **同 key 挤满**：一个 key 超过 3 个会有人进不来/被挤  \n  → 提前做分片 key（`xx_01/xx_02`）\n\n- **名字冲突**：多个 agent 名字太像，面板看不懂  \n  → 统一命名：`部门-角色-编号`（如 `兵部-巡检-01`）\n\n只要这三点做到，整体会很稳。  \n要不要我现在就给你一版“**可直接落地的最稳配置清单**”（key 命名 + 分组 + 备用 key）？","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01a0ede22534998d0169aebc62cdd88191b612639efd445c72\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":629,"output":238,"cacheRead":27136,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28003,"cost":{"input":0.00110075,"output":0.003332,"cacheRead":0.0047488,"cacheWrite":0,"t