{"type":"message","id":"9729b906","parentId":"649c4cea","timestamp":"2026-03-09T12:50:34.791Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Proposing template parsing plan**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_01a0ede22534998d0169aec20a36248191a630732f80eb5331\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABprsIM6EuXsVp1GzPPh25yLzr4Eo9aZEE8c5h00cgMLaBrQ3Qt5aF5wvMi8-62rwUgITDsQnW3E7J99TrhzwvJtBp7y6r9wU73Ny9ZWyf9J-sc904eBXopY45cQ7eUXZtIHzS67q5hyJDAAZ4UifjoCuQeRjBZSUAJmxA8ql-LfqRSieRI58Sq_Y2889PvD9BJER0Yjbf0L2RDpKwr-MeF6WGlZSEEXj6o-O5Crc6gabyqC0vdUFvU1Osj4tQWubmD9QkzZ4NvWD8t2zxCMxWVhJ_e3a0vd_F9gkHIJ-SzJoABGmbsXZOgKrHvEITk5lBfeiDCi6jjkUer9SXnHiStdbRPbikwwrI_gIPQVWI6HaWEJBdjvAixgEg1sTMnJf5iyeal6SW2M8I376SSkZv9SyzzxC6QrT61JIcvlrPLjm9PeK_1QsjsxNRkDcF9jqCUCL6khLsR2PCx-8-VoJDVzv-pCXqlQl4BBi2G0d-MZtgJAyC3HZbeDHuj3gfLwFqIApKP1MTEdjZQ6s2qmVoOtxIYT73AYRmiq0bwRY6Ilv2pt4U5oGmTBwpuSnay0YyNQctJ5dtGN5EX09vKF51vQqeBrSw2sDBFjdWRbvClibUvLMPknwKqstjdCxzJ0_i9symX4mv81cKDpBbIhL8UccWMhFGzFOCcP0sQMpJbXHm7e7ZEKwTakw5xOisFBjhf2YNYQ1iBBGRGIu9plulIkSyb0wu72EnRhKE4f2yBvkn2GDDtMztRS252Yw-NIMgCFyBVbeH2jItIvFj10Fu5QME-_iicgFGqtlzcFyGIGXv4dRrfvvRKSMAp2DZYYCywucIkoNd6PQOPJ3Ulhc0qxv1S17L7icVQTie-CgQBNuPC_BJD9nOVvIXCVr874rdjCKHfTWOV_V0AGj0xaF5-ED2hpYE2Yv2Xy2LQZL2B5cuGi-PwSGhD8qiiZydMcCKIZye0CvI7UugzXIARRkHa5e6gZQOF6Iqy9ZUTB3wnrLS9lFsrH5A1EgS3ASe5pOikqKW03qpACJr3-NZwO4dgp9Ymn382BdrpRFrfC0GFNsvLmso8N6gLy8UDvTHnUHIJW757L8rW_SpKxyOhG2nphgEwYJ3GLwuOFRK1xtOmH2PjTifONOhp5wQXQY1QuEkCeiEANnqXOgbWvoly4Rjuak-fpzfgBgafGS65wdZ2tmN5OtwVhX3T4YC0lbaxv_XizPbPdhP2pX5CI6hPdn8BsHAMWWGFJRuBmCNI-cnd1QuNuz8Kq1PuRLdKK9HA_pJ2JQqf\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Proposing template parsing plan**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 你判断完全对。  \n根因就是：现在是“把案例塞进模板”，不是“先理解模板每列语义再生成案例”。\n\n你这个模板不是通用表头，它有明显的**业务语义列**（而且有合并单元格、分层表头），所以必须加一层：\n\n**模板解析器（Template Semantic Parser）**  \n先输出类似这样的结构，再生成用例：\n\n- A列 `大分類`：场景域（基本固定）\n- B列 `No.`：序号公式\n- C列 `小分類`：测试主题（正常/异常+具体点）\n- D列 `確認手順`：操作步骤（可执行）\n- E列 `アカウント`：账号条件（可空）\n- F列 `テスト条件`：输入条件（空值/不正值/边界值）\n- G列 `想定結果`：预期（含报错 message 原文）\n- H~K：执行结果区（通常不由生成器填）\n\n然后生成器要变成“按列产出”，不是自由拼句。\n\n---\n\n我建议下一步这样改（一次到位）：\n\n1) 新增 `parse_template_semantics.py`  \n- 读取第6/7行分层表头  \n- 识别每列角色 + 是否应写入 + 样例行风格\n\n2) 新增 `generate_cases_by_template_semantics.py`  \n- 先产结构化字段：`subcategory/steps/condition/expected_message`  \n- 再严格映射到 C/D/F/G（A固定，B公式）\n\n3) 导出器加“列白名单”  \n- 只写 A/B/C/D/F/G  \n- E/H/I/J/K 默认保留模板原样（或按规则填空）\n\n---\n\n你一句话我就开工：  \n**“按模板语义解析版重构”**。  \n我会先给你 5 条样例（逐列对照），你确认后再全量生成。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01a0ede22534998d0169aec20c88b881918f08d32e2468524b\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":576,"output":517,"cacheRead":61568,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":62661,"cost":{"input":0.001008,"output":0.007238,"cacheRead":0.0107744,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0190204}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773060621917}}
