{"type":"message","id":"7c90cb96","parentId":"e2528801","timestamp":"2026-03-09T13:16:11.970Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 现在按你这套 **V3 agent**，这样生成就行：\n\n在目录：\n`skills/web-unit-testbook`\n\n执行一条命令（推荐）：\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py `\n  --design \"你的设计书.xlsx\" `\n  --code \"你的代码目录或zip\" `\n  --outdir \"workspace/runs/run-$(Get-Date -Format yyyyMMdd-HHmm)\"\n```\n\n默认会用：\n- 模板：`workspace/inputs/template/template_v3_confirmed.xlsx`\n\n输出会在 `--outdir` 里生成：\n- `design_rules.json`\n- `code_rules.json`\n- `cases.json`\n- `UnitTestSpec_UIOnly.md`\n- `unit_test_book_v3_template_based.xlsx`  ← 这个就是最终单体测试书\n\n---\n\n如果你想显式指定模板（可选）：\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py `\n  --design \"你的设计书.xlsx\" `\n  --code \"你的代码.zip\" `\n  --template \"workspace/inputs/template/template_v3_confirmed.xlsx\" `\n  --outdir \"workspace/runs/run-20260309-final\"\n```\n\n你要的话，我也可以现在直接帮你跑一次（你只要把 design/code 文件名再确认给我）。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01a0ede22534998d0169aec8100f948191a8a41bf9b5d95c51\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":3601,"output":279,"cacheRead":90240,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":94120,"cost":{"input":0.00630175,"output":0.0039059999999999997,"cacheRead":0.015792,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.025999750000000002}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773062161431}}
